      "created_at": "2014-07-09T19:40:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep - any cards which buff all damage by X amount and deal damage themselves will have the buff applied to themselves. Other cards which have the same kind of effect are the Explosive Wagons (Silver Gulch) and the Contract (Chairman), which both deal damage which is buffed by themselves.</p>",
